{"type":"message","id":"5ab97a80","parentId":"ee6e832f","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:18:57.347Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[cron:f6b9edc7-5375-4a0a-b88b-3989ad8ab3eb skill-evolution-hourly] 执行自动进化任务：1. 搜索 ClawHub 上最新的高效技能（搜索关键词：calendar, task, document, meeting, email, notes, productivity, automation）；2. 筛选下载量>100且6个月内更新的技能；3. 安装有价值的技能；4. 生成简短报告记录到 memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\nCurrent time: Friday, March 13th, 2026 — 5:18 AM (Asia/Shanghai)\n\nReturn your summary as plain text; it will be delivered automatically. If the task explicitly calls for messaging a specific external recipient, note who/where it should go instead of sending it yourself."}],"timestamp":1773350337346}}
{"type":"message","id":"9b33c001","parentId":"5ab97a80","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:19:05.183Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"This is a cron-triggered task asking me to:\n1. Search ClawHub for latest productivity skills with specific keywords\n2. Filter by downloads >100 and updated within 6 months\n3. Install valuable skills\n4. Generate a short report to memory/evolution-YYYY-MM-DD.md\n\nThe current date is Friday, March 13th, 2026 (5:18 AM).\n\nLet me first read the clawhub skill to understand how to search and install skills from ClawHub.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_4bbc01170c8d47f694ad2fa0","name":"read","arguments":{"file_path":"/opt/homebrew/lib/node_modules/openclaw/skills/clawhub/SKILL.md"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":12065,"output":130,"cacheRead":3392,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":15587,"cost":{"input":0.012065,"output":0.00041600000000000003,"cacheRead":0.0006784,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.013159399999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773350337347}}
{"type":"message","id":"824c3e07","parentId":"9b33c001","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:19:05.189Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_4bbc01170c8d47f694ad2fa0","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"---\nname: clawhub\ndescription: Use the ClawHub CLI to search, install, update, and publish agent skills from clawhub.com. Use when you need to fetch new skills on the fly, sync installed skills to latest or a specific version, or publish new/updated skill folders with the npm-installed clawhub CLI.\nmetadata:\n  {\n    \"openclaw\":\n      {\n        \"requires\": { \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"] },\n        \"install\":\n          [\n            {\n              \"id\": \"node\",\n              \"kind\": \"node\",\n              \"package\": \"clawhub\",\n              \"bins\": [\"clawhub\"],\n              \"label\": \"Install ClawHub CLI (npm)\",\n            },\n          ],\n      },\n  }\n---\n\n# ClawHub CLI\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nnpm i -g clawhub\n```\n\nAuth (publish)\n\n```bash\nclawhub login\nclawhub whoami\n```\n\nSearch\n\n```bash\nclawhub search \"postgres backups\"\n```\n\nInstall\n\n```bash\nclawhub install my-skill\nclawhub install my-skill --version 1.2.3\n```\n\nUpdate (hash-based match + upgrade)\n\n```bash\nclawhub update my-skill\nclawhub update my-skill --version 1.2.3\nclawhub update --all\nclawhub update my-skill --force\nclawhub update --all --no-input --force\n```\n\nList\n\n```bash\nclawhub list\n```\n\nPublish\n\n```bash\nclawhub publish ./my-skill --slug my-skill --name \"My Skill\" --version 1.2.0 --changelog \"Fixes + docs\"\n```\n\nNotes\n\n- Default registry: https://clawhub.com (override with CLAWHUB_REGISTRY or --registry)\n- Default workdir: cwd (falls back to OpenClaw workspace); install dir: ./skills (override with --workdir / --dir / CLAWHUB_WORKDIR)\n- Update command hashes local files, resolves matching version, and upgrades to latest unless --version is set\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1773350345188}}
{"type":"message","id":"d06b1e01","parentId":"824c3e07","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:19:10.454Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I now understand the ClawHub CLI. Let me search for skills using the specified keywords:\n- calendar\n- task\n- document\n- meeting\n- email\n- notes\n- productivity\n- automation\n\nI'll run multiple searches in parallel to find skills.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"开始执行自动进化任务。首先搜索 ClawHub 上的高效技能："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_8fb0e376a2bc4a0caf80bd30","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"calendar\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5f12b1d0e5394190a10990f5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"task\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b758f6cc6f0c4e04965591cf","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"document\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_d0343812f8b4490788eec7b2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"meeting\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_14a151cdadfc422a8185d28d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"email\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_aaea58f81c9d49dc8454d765","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"notes\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7738552c1dff4e098f9a1ae3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"productivity\" 2>/dev/null"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_67ff2557254b4e5dab218e31","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub search \"automation\" 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":609,"output":233,"cacheRead":15424,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":16266,"cost":{"input":0.000609,"output":0.0007456,"cacheRead":0.0030848000000000004,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0044394000000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773350345189}}
