{"type":"message","id":"3e7c8327","parentId":"4e31c78d","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:19:33.805Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, I have search results. Now I need to get more details about these skills to filter by:\n1. Downloads > 100\n2. Updated within 6 months\n\nLet me check the details of the top skills from each category. I'll use `clawhub info` or look at the ClawHub website to get more details about downloads and update dates.\n\nActually, the search results don't show download counts or update dates. Let me try to get more info about the promising skills. I'll check if there's an info command or if I need to use the web.\n\nLet me try clawhub info or clawhub show to get details.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_24231bb281ca4ac8a48a4c9d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub --help 2>/dev/null"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":1524,"output":153,"cacheRead":16000,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":17677,"cost":{"input":0.001524,"output":0.0004896000000000001,"cacheRead":0.0032,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0052136000000000005}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773350366461}}
{"type":"message","id":"6e3cdea2","parentId":"3e7c8327","timestamp":"2026-03-12T21:19:34.073Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_24231bb281ca4ac8a48a4c9d","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":266,"aggregated":"Usage: clawhub [options] [command]\n\nClawHub CLI v0.7.0\ninstall, update, search, and publish agent skills.\n\nOptions:\n  -V, --cli-version                       Show CLI version\n  --workdir <dir>                         Working directory (default: cwd)\n  --dir <dir>                             Skills directory (relative to workdir, default: skills)\n  --site <url>                            Site base URL (for browser login)\n  --registry <url>                        Registry API base URL\n  --no-input                              Disable prompts\n  -h, --help                              display help for command\n\nCommands:\n  login [options]                         Log in (opens browser or stores token)\n  logout                                  Remove stored token\n  whoami                                  Validate token\n  auth                                    Authentication commands\n  search [options] <query...>             Vector search skills\n  install [options] <slug>                Install into <dir>/<slug>\n  update [options] [slug]                 Update installed skills\n  uninstall [options] <slug>              Uninstall a skill\n  list                                    List installed skills (from lockfile)\n  explore [options]                       Browse latest updated skills from the registry\n  inspect [options] <slug>                Fetch skill metadata and files without installing\n  publish [options] <path>                Publish skill from folder\n  delete [options] <slug>                 Soft-delete a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  hide [options] <slug>                   Hide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  undelete [options] <slug>               Restore a hidden skill (moderator/admin only)\n  unhide [options] <slug>                 Unhide a skill (moderator/admin only)\n  ban-user [options] <handleOrId>         Ban a user and delete owned skills (moderator/admin only)\n  set-role [options] <handleOrId> <role>  Change a user role (admin only)\n  star [options] <slug>                   Add a skill to your highlights\n  unstar [options] <slug>                 Remove a skill from your highlights\n  sync [options]                          Scan local skills and publish new/updated ones\n\nEnv:\n  CLAWHUB_SITE\n  CLAWHUB_REGISTRY\n  CLAWHUB_WORKDIR\n  (CLAWDHUB_* supported)","cwd":"/Users/ciss-ai/.openclaw/agents/zongzhu"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1773350374072}}
