ion\": \"1.0.2\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1771476812023,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Documentation reworked and simplified for clarity and easier reference.\\n- Audience broadened: Skill now addresses general browser automation, not just sandboxed/cloud use.\\n- Install modes, tunnel setup, and environment variable explanations are removed for a more concise guide.\\n- New dedicated sections for browser modes, session management, essential commands, and Python execution.\\n- Updated and better-organized CLI command reference.\\n- Usage examples and options for real/Chromium/cloud browsers are clarified with practical guidance.\\n- For full advanced setup details, directs users to the official README.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"blogwatcher\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Blogwatcher\",\n      \"summary\": \"Monitor blogs and RSS/Atom feeds for updates using the blogwatcher CLI.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 23729,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 939,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 923,\n        \"stars\": 40,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545299849,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545299849,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"model-usage\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Model Usage\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use CodexBar CLI local cost usage to summarize per-model usage for Codex or Claude, including the current (most recent) model or a full model breakdown. Trigger when asked for model-level usage/cost data from codexbar, or when you need a scriptable per-model summary from codexbar cost JSON.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 23401,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1050,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1030,\n        \"stars\": 85,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065235893,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767667639455,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the model-usage skill for summarizing per-model usage and cost from CodexBar CLI local cost logs.\\n- Supports both Codex and Claude providers.\\n- Allows fetching summaries for the current (most recent) model or all models.\\n- Provides both text and JSON output formats.\\n- Can process costs directly from CodexBar CLI output or from a JSON file/stdin.\\n- Includes guidance for CLI use and script automation.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"darwin\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gmail\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gmail\",\n      \"summary\": \"Gmail API integration with managed OAuth. Read, send, and manage emails, threads, labels, and drafts. Use this skill when users want to interact with Gmail. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.6\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 23130,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 206,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 193,\n        \"stars\": 60,\n        \"versions\": 7\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770021074275,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.6\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770755759017,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added clawdbot metadata for skill compatibility and requirements.\\n- Declared required environment variable (`MATON_API_KEY`) in the metadata section.\\n- No changes to functional documentation or API usage.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"nextCursor\": \"0710cccf47ac7aa79c63902144862480e6950b0e2e63855068ea83c42c3871fb2ba4b95fdcf4e4ad1d4973370f133369a6e377f036f27a447f4df96e33222325671b6c80f1233e495f7474daa7c3770ab627a9a2047234b47071112a0947ed1ed4a8590ace3b6834e7b18a6881cead0c3c5c8448b8c68770d5edb2ae8901f41d14a8a2fc05\"\n}"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":1463,"aggregated":"{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"displayName\": \"self-improving-agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Captures learnings, errors, and corrections to enable continuous improvement. Use when: (1) A command or operation fails unexpectedly, (2) User corrects Clau...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"3.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 48,\n        \"downloads\": 189764,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2897,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2792,\n        \"stars\": 1884,\n        \"versions\": 14\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767632598365,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773230508805,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"3.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773230308177,\n        \"changelog\": \"Version 3.0.1 – Expanded documentation, clarified workflow, and OpenClaw integration\\n\\n- Major overhaul of SKILL.md with detailed instructions for logging errors, learnings, and feature requests.\\n- Added comprehensive quick reference tables for when and how to log issues and promote learnings.\\n- Included complete setup steps for OpenClaw and generic (non-OpenClaw) agents, with directory structure and file descriptions.\\n- Standardized formats for recording learnings, errors, and feature requests, including metadata and resolution process.\\n- Documented promotion workflow to elevate important learnings to project memory files.\\n- Clarified inter-session communication tools within OpenClaw for sharing and reviewing learnings.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"find-skills\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Find Skills\",\n      \"summary\": \"Helps users discover and install agent skills when they ask questions like \\\"how do I do X\\\", \\\"find a skill for X\\\", \\\"is there a skill that can...\\\", or express interest in extending capabilities. This skill should be used when the user is looking for functionality that might exist as an installable skill.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 184690,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2656,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2611,\n        \"stars\": 773,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772893878086,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769698710765,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the find-skills skill.\\n- Helps users discover and install agent skills when looking for new functionality or extending agent capabilities.\\n- Provides clear guidance on searching for, presenting, and installing skills using Skills CLI commands.\\n- Includes examples and tips for effective skill discovery across common categories like web development, testing, and DevOps.\\n- Offers fallback options when no relevant skills are found, including help with tasks directly and guidance on creating new skills.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"summarize\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Summarize\",\n      \"summary\": \"Summarize URLs or files with the summarize CLI (web, PDFs, images, audio, YouTube).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 11,\n        \"downloads\": 141905,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 3084,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 3031,\n        \"stars\": 552,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773139650650,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545383635,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"agent-browser\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Agent Browser\",\n      \"summary\": \"A fast Rust-based headless browser automation CLI with Node.js fallback that enables AI agents to navigate, click, type, and snapshot pages via structured commands.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"automation\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"browser\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"headless\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"latest\": \"0.2.0\",\n        \"web\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 116833,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2054,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2009,\n        \"stars\": 521,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768170466579,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773284512741,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.2.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768882342488,\n        \"changelog\": \"**Big update: Expanded documentation and new contribution guidelines.**\\n\\n- Added a CONTRIBUTING.md file with guidelines for contributors.\\n- Significantly revised and expanded SKILL.md:\\n  - Clearer structure, concise “Quick start,” and streamlined “Core workflow.”\\n  - Added or reorganized sections: video recording, mouse control, semantic locators, browser settings, cookies/storage, network, tabs, frames, dialogs, JS, and session state management.\\n  - More comprehensive examples and improved command explanations.\\n- Introduced allowed-tools field in SKILL.md for clearer operational context.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"gog\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Gog\",\n      \"summary\": \"Google Workspace CLI for Gmail, Calendar, Drive, Contacts, Sheets, and Docs.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 36,\n        \"downloads\": 107327,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2242,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2183,\n        \"stars\": 708,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772180053316,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545346060,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"github\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Github\",\n      \"summary\": \"Interact with GitHub using the `gh` CLI. Use `gh issue`, `gh pr`, `gh run`, and `gh api` for issues, PRs, CI runs, and advanced queries.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 101212,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2439,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2395,\n        \"stars\": 327,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545344344,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"ontology\",\n      \"displayName\": \"ontology\",\n      \"summary\": \"Typed knowledge graph for structured agent memory and composable skills. Use when creating/querying entities (Person, Project, Task, Event, Document), linkin...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.4\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 98205,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 215,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 205,\n        \"stars\": 250,\n        \"versions\": 4\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769415435751,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773250316960,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.4\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773249559725,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Initial release of the ontology skill for typed, constraint-validated knowledge graphs.\\n- Supports entity and relation CRUD, property and relation validation, and graph traversal for common types such as Person, Project, Task, Event, and Document.\\n- Provides schema-driven constraints including required properties, enums, forbidden fields, cardinality, and acyclicity.\\n- Enables multi-step planning and shared memory across skills via structured ontology objects.\\n- Includes CLI tooling for creating, querying, linking, and validating graph data using JSONL storage.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"proactive-agent\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Proactive Agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Transform AI agents from task-followers into proactive partners that anticipate needs and continuously improve. Now with WAL Protocol, Working Buffer, Autonomous Crons, and battle-tested patterns. Part of the Hal Stack 🦞\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"3.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 19,\n        \"downloads\": 90914,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1297,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1263,\n        \"stars\": 523,\n        \"versions\": 11\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769629545209,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772161938714,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"3.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770259214202,\n        \"changelog\": \"Added: Autonomous vs Prompted Crons, Verify Implementation Not Intent, Tool Migration Checklist\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"weather\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Weather\",\n      \"summary\": \"Get current weather and forecasts (no API key required).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 6,\n        \"downloads\": 86792,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 2114,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 2078,\n        \"stars\": 271,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772616922629,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545394459,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"skill-vetter\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Skill Vetter\",\n      \"summary\": \"Security-first skill vetting for AI agents. Use before installing any skill from ClawdHub, GitHub, or other sources. Checks for red flags, permission scope, and suspicious patterns.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 76169,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1330,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1318,\n        \"stars\": 297,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769863429632,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065836042,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769863429632,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release - Security-first skill vetting for AI agents\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"self-improving\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Self-Improving + Proactive Agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"Self-reflection + Self-criticism + Self-learning + Self-organizing memory. Agent evaluates its own work, catches mistakes, and improves permanently. Use when...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.2.16\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 0,\n        \"downloads\": 57857,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 704,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 675,\n        \"stars\": 282,\n        \"versions\": 22\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1771266418607,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773329514597,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.2.16\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773329327755,\n        \"changelog\": \"Clarifies the setup flow for proactive follow-through and safer installation behavior.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"linux\",\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"win32\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"sonoscli\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Sonoscli\",\n      \"summary\": \"Control Sonos speakers (discover/status/play/volume/group).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 55677,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1758,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1696,\n        \"stars\": 38,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545381030,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545381030,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"nano-pdf\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Nano Pdf\",\n      \"summary\": \"Edit PDFs with natural-language instructions using the nano-pdf CLI.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 53932,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1397,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1374,\n        \"stars\": 122,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545359433,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065240363,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545359433,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"notion\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Notion\",\n      \"summary\": \"Notion API for creating and managing pages, databases, and blocks.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 52110,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1435,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1417,\n        \"stars\": 179,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545360889,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773122478761,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545360889,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"humanizer\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Humanizer\",\n      \"summary\": \"Remove signs of AI-generated writing from text. Use when editing or reviewing\\ntext to make it sound more natural and human-written. Based on Wikipedia's\\ncomprehensive \\\"Signs of AI writing\\\" guide. Detects and fixes patterns including:\\ninflated symbolism, promotional language, superficial -ing analyses, vague\\nattributions, em dash overuse, rule of three, AI vocabulary words, negative\\nparallelisms, and excessive conjunctive phrases.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 7,\n        \"downloads\": 49912,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 589,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 575,\n        \"stars\": 377,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769231736865,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773185837479,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769231736865,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release - Remove AI writing patterns based on Wikipedia's Signs of AI Writing guide. Detects 24 patterns including inflated symbolism, AI vocabulary, em dash overuse, and more.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"obsidian\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Obsidian\",\n      \"summary\": \"Work with Obsidian vaults (plain Markdown notes) and automate via obsidian-cli.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 9,\n        \"downloads\": 47611,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1404,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1380,\n        \"stars\": 193,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545362143,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773284421919,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545362143,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"nano-banana-pro\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Nano Banana Pro\",\n      \"summary\": \"Generate/edit images with Nano Banana Pro (Gemini 3 Pro Image). Use for image create/modify requests incl. edits. Supports text-to-image + image-to-image; 1K/2K/4K; use --input-image.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 46259,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1145,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1130,\n        \"stars\": 193,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545358090,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773284420438,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767651987917,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"multi-search-engine\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Multi Search Engine\",\n      \"summary\": \"Multi search engine integration with 17 engines (8 CN + 9 Global). Supports advanced search operators, time filters, site search, privacy engines, and WolframAlpha knowledge queries. No API keys required.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"2.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 4,\n        \"downloads\": 43669,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 535,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 524,\n        \"stars\": 236,\n        \"versions\": 3\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770221093765,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772063741465,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"2.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770313848158,\n        \"changelog\": \"**Multi-search-engine v2.0.1 Changelog**\\n\\n- Updated documentation for conciseness, focusing on essential usage, supported engines, operators, and example queries.\\n- Removed the file `references/advanced-search.md` to streamline advanced search documentation.\\n- Revised and unified description to highlight 17 search engines, advanced operators, privacy-focused engines, and knowledge computation.\\n- Cleaned up and reorganized SKILL.md; made operator and time filter tables clearer for easier reference.\\n- Updated metadata in config and documentation files for accuracy and clarity.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"openai-whisper\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Openai Whisper\",\n      \"summary\": \"Local speech-to-text with the Whisper CLI (no API key).\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 42515,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1199,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1174,\n        \"stars\": 198,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545365755,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767545365755,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"api-gateway\",\n      \"displayName\": \"API Gateway\",\n      \"summary\": \"Connect to 100+ APIs (Google Workspace, Microsoft 365, GitHub, Notion, Slack, Airtable, HubSpot, etc.) with managed OAuth. Use this skill when users want to...\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.67\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 2,\n        \"downloads\": 41116,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 226,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 218,\n        \"stars\": 205,\n        \"versions\": 68\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769935067126,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773314215262,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.67\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773313606464,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Added references/one-note/README.md file.\\n- No changes to existing functionality; update consists of new documentation or reference material.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"auto-updater\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Auto-Updater Skill\",\n      \"summary\": \"Automatically update Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily. Runs via cron, checks for updates, applies them, and messages the user with a summary of what changed.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 40361,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 639,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 613,\n        \"stars\": 253,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1768323539453,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772074932947,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1768323539453,\n        \"changelog\": \"Automatically checks for and applies updates to Clawdbot and all installed skills once daily via cron.\\n\\nSends the user a message summarizing what was updated and any issues encountered.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": [\n          \"darwin\",\n          \"linux\"\n        ],\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"brave-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Brave Search\",\n      \"summary\": \"Web search and content extraction via Brave Search API. Use for searching documentation, facts, or any web content. Lightweight, no browser required.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 5,\n        \"downloads\": 37150,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 495,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 471,\n        \"stars\": 142,\n        \"versions\": 2\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1767545304976,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773128298472,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.0.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1767651953714,\n        \"changelog\": \"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"skill-creator\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Skill Creator\",\n      \"summary\": \"Guide for creating effective skills. This skill should be used when users want to create a new skill (or update an existing skill) that extends Claude's capabilities with specialized knowledge, workflows, or tool integrations.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 3,\n        \"downloads\": 37099,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1220,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 1199,\n        \"stars\": 127,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1769522677376,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773284926090,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1769522677376,\n        \"changelog\": \"Initial release of skill-creator, a comprehensive guide for designing modular skills to extend Claude’s capabilities.\\n\\n- Introduces principles for creating effective, concise, and domain-specific skills.\\n- Explains modular structure: required SKILL.md and optional scripts, references, and assets folders.\\n- Outlines guidelines for what to include (and exclude) in a skill package.\\n- Details progressive disclosure design for efficient context management.\\n- Provides reference patterns for organizing content and bundling resources.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"automation-workflows\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Automation Workflows\",\n      \"summary\": \"Design and implement automation workflows to save time and scale operations as a solopreneur. Use when identifying repetitive tasks to automate, building workflows across tools, setting up triggers and actions, or optimizing existing automations. Covers automation opportunity identification, workflow design, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), testing, and maintenance. Trigger on \\\"automate\\\", \\\"automation\\\", \\\"workflow automation\\\", \\\"save time\\\", \\\"reduce manual work\\\", \\\"automate my business\\\", \\\"no-code automation\\\".\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"0.1.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 35811,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 442,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 429,\n        \"stars\": 160,\n        \"versions\": 1\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770341582349,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1772065840450,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"0.1.0\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1770341582349,\n        \"changelog\": \"automation-workflows 0.1.0 initial release:\\n\\n- Launches comprehensive playbook for solopreneurs to design and implement no-code automation workflows.\\n- Covers identifying automation opportunities, workflow design principles, tool selection (Zapier, Make, n8n), and best practices for testing.\\n- Includes maintenance and troubleshooting guidance to ensure reliability.\\n- Provides ready-made workflow templates and advanced automation ideas.\\n- Triggers include common phrases like \\\"automation,\\\" \\\"workflows,\\\" \\\"save time,\\\" and \\\"no-code automation.\\\"\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"baidu-search\",\n      \"displayName\": \"baidu web search\",\n      \"summary\": \"Search the web using Baidu AI Search Engine (BDSE). Use for live information, documentation, or research topics.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.1.1\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 18,\n        \"downloads\": 35681,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 316,\n        \"installsCurrent\": 307,\n        \"stars\": 82,\n        \"versions\": 9\n      },\n      \"createdAt\": 1770291754419,\n      \"updatedAt\": 1773287521996,\n      \"latestVersion\": {\n        \"version\": \"1.1.1\",\n        \"createdAt\": 1773127227674,\n        \"changelog\": \"- Updated request parameters: simplified to include only query, count, and freshness.\\n- Added support for new freshness formats (\\\"YYYY-MM-DDtoYYYY-MM-DD\\\" and short codes pd/pw/pm/py).\\n- Default and range for count parameter clarified (default 10, range 1–50).\\n- Examples and usage instructions revised for new parameter set.\\n- Removed advanced resource and search filter options from documentation for simplicity.\\n- _meta.json file removed.\",\n        \"license\": null\n      },\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"os\": null,\n        \"systems\": null\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"slug\": \"mcporter\",\n      \"displayName\": \"Mcporter\",\n      \"summary\": \"Use the mcporter CLI to list, configure, auth, and call MCP servers/tools directly (HTTP or stdio), including ad-hoc servers, config edits, and CLI/type generation.\",\n      \"tags\": {\n        \"latest\": \"1.0.0\"\n      },\n      \"stats\": {\n        \"comments\": 1,\n        \"downloads\": 34861,\n        \"installsAllTime\": 1188,\n        \"i