ly (40k downloads)\n4. **api-gateway** - Access to 100+ APIs (41k downloads)\n5. **elite-longterm-memory** - Enhanced memory system (28k downloads)\n6. **news-summary** - News briefings (22k downloads)\n\nLet me install these valuable skills.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"已安装技能非常丰富。现在筛选有价值的新技能进行安装："},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_7a7881cd083948ca8e3dd671","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install notion 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_10795717535849c292fb154c","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install himalaya 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_429c3b9eb8b647e4b81176d0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install auto-updater 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_ec202e9ac302403d912936d3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install api-gateway 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_5eb668f9147349c5a1ba929e","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install elite-longterm-memory 2>&1"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_2291626bafc6476ba8b27a74","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"clawhub install news-summary 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai","model":"glm-5","usage":{"input":922,"output":661,"cacheRead":37376,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":38959,"cost":{"input":0.000922,"output":0.0021152000000000002,"cacheRead":0.0074752,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.010512400000000002}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773350447228}}
